--- main thread
isMainThread true threadId 0
--- echo
threadId 1
echo: online | message {"hello":true,"threadId":1,"isMainThread":false,"data":{"mode":"echo","pid":"number","nested":{"a":[1,2]}},"samePid":true,"argv":["x","y"],"execArgv":[]} | message {"echo":"before online"} | message {"echo":{"n":1}} | exit 0
--- process.exit
worker stdout before exit
exit: online | message "before exit" | exit 3
code 3
--- uncaught error
throw: online | message "before throw" | error RangeError undefined boom from worker | exit 1
throw value: online | error 42 | exit 1
