--- unsupported in a worker
unsupported: online | message ["chdir ERR_WORKER_UNSUPPORTED_OPERATION process.chdir() is not supported in workers","abort ERR_WORKER_UNSUPPORTED_OPERATION process.abort() is not supported in workers","umask set ERR_WORKER_UNSUPPORTED_OPERATION Setting process.umask() is not supported in workers","setuid ERR_WORKER_UNSUPPORTED_OPERATION process.setuid() is not supported in workers","umask read number"] | exit 0
--- errors
bare name TypeError ERR_WORKER_PATH The worker script or module filename must be an absolute path or a relative path starting with './' or '../'. Received "w.js"
not a string TypeError ERR_INVALID_ARG_TYPE The "filename" argument must be of type string or an instance of URL. Received type number (42)
eval not a string TypeError ERR_INVALID_ARG_VALUE The property 'options.eval' must be false when 'filename' is not a string. Received true
bad argv TypeError ERR_INVALID_ARG_TYPE The "options.argv" property must be an instance of Array. Received type string ('x')
bad env TypeError ERR_INVALID_ARG_TYPE The "options.env" property must be of type object or one of undefined, null, or worker_threads.SHARE_ENV. Received type number (1)
bad resourceLimits no throw
--- unref
unref: the program ends with the worker running
